      "description": "<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>This module count as <strong>two enable modules</strong></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>This <strong>personal vehicle</strong> can fly, and its <strong>distance</strong> becomes ×3.</p>\n    <p>While you are driving this <strong>personal vehicle</strong>, your melee attacks can target <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-id=\"q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Flying</a> creatures, and none of the creatures inside the <strong>personal vehicle</strong> can be targeted by melee attacks unless the attacker is <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-id=\"q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Flying</a> or is somehow able to reach <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-id=\"q6keqwDWUsEgSWDw\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Flying</a> targets.</p>\n    <p>These benefits do not apply while the <strong>personal vehicle</strong> is inactive or grounded, while you are in <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-id=\"GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Crisis</a>, or while you are covering another creature with the <strong>Guard</strong> action.</p>\n    <p>Additionally, if a creature aboard this <strong>personal vehicle</strong> suffers <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\">Air</a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-id=\"5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-type=\"Item\">Bolt</a> or <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-id=\"Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-type=\"Item\">Ice</a> damage during a conflict, the benefits of this module cease until the start of your next turn.</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n",
